    {
      "source": "Return the passcode header value, or <code>null</code> if not set.",
      "translation": "返回密码头值，如果未设置则返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "An instance of this class can also be created by wrapping an existing\n<code>Message</code>. That message may have been created with the more generic\n<a href=\"../SimpMessageHeaderAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp\"><code>SimpMessageHeaderAccessor</code></a> in\nwhich case STOMP headers are created from common processing headers.\nIn this case it is also necessary to invoke either\n<a href=\"#updateStompCommandAsClientMessage()\"><code>updateStompCommandAsClientMessage()</code></a> or\n<a href=\"#updateStompCommandAsServerMessage()\"><code>updateStompCommandAsServerMessage()</code></a> if sending a message and\ndepending on whether a message is sent to a client or the message broker.",
      "translation": "该类的一个实例也可以通过包装现有的 `<code>Message</code>` 来创建。该消息可能是使用更通用的 <a href=\"../SimpMessageHeaderAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp\"><code>SimpMessageHeaderAccessor</code></a> 创建的，在这种情况下，STOMP 标头将从通用处理标头中生成。在此情况下，如果发送消息，并且取决于消息是发送到客户端还是消息代理，还必须调用 <a href=\"#updateStompCommandAsClientMessage()\"><code>updateStompCommandAsClientMessage()</code></a> 或 <a href=\"#updateStompCommandAsServerMessage()\"><code>updateStompCommandAsServerMessage()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "When created from STOMP frame content, the actual STOMP headers are\nstored in the native header sub-map managed by the parent class\n<a href=\"../../support/NativeMessageHeaderAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>NativeMessageHeaderAccessor</code></a>\nwhile the parent class <a href=\"../SimpMessageHeaderAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp\"><code>SimpMessageHeaderAccessor</code></a> manages common\nprocessing headers some of which are based on STOMP headers\n(for example, destination, content-type, etc).",
      "translation": "从 STOMP 帧内容创建时，实际的 STOMP 头信息存储在由父类<a href=\"../../support/NativeMessageHeaderAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>NativeMessageHeaderAccessor</code></a>管理的原生头子映射中，而父类<a href=\"../SimpMessageHeaderAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp\"><code>SimpMessageHeaderAccessor</code></a>则管理一些通用的处理头信息，其中部分基于 STOMP 头信息（例如目标地址、内容类型等）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
